<title>BELGIUM: Brussels bourse closed for New Year holiday.</title>
<headline>Brussels bourse closed for New Year holiday.</headline>
<text>
<p>0815 GMT - The Brussels bourse is closed for the New Year holiday on Tuesday and Wednesday. It will reopen on Thursday.</p>
<p>On Monday the Bel-20 index closed 0.12 percent higher at 1,895.49.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
